<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 16.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 180.00    0.90</p>
<p> 2   Telecasters Nqld     15.36    5.21</p>
<p> 3   Hills Inds	     14.86    1.75</p>
<p> 4   Schroder Intl	  10.11    2.38</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	10.10    0.97</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   9.89    0.92</p>
<p> 7   Aust Tour		 9.62    0.78</p>
